# Decoupled Tensor64 Instructions Fields

%inst64lo 7:25
%inst64hi 32:32

# Argument sets:

&tensor64 inst64lo inst64hi

# Formats Decoupled Tensor64:
@tensor64    ................................ ......................... ....... &tensor64 %inst64lo %inst64hi

# Tensor Extension
tx64_all          ................................ ......................... 0111111 @tensor64
